<p>As the in-cage leader for Rampage Sports, Danni is the one who sets the tone for her teammates. Highly skilled and tough as nails, she is among the most feared and accomplished fighters in the league. She is also one of the most modest. Modest, but not stupid.  She knows she's good, and she carries herself accordingly.  She consistently downplays her own abilities and often wonders why her friends and stablemates treat her with such reverence.</p>

<p>Outside of the cage, she is the glue that holds the stable together. She displays an almost mystical ability to spot trouble before it starts.  Two training partners not getting along?  Danni can set them straight before it gets out of hand.  A fighter not performing up to her abilities?  Danni can tell you what the problem is and how to fix it. She is a master at managing relationships.</p>

<p>Together with Development Coordinator Stephanie McMahon, Danni makes sure each fighter gets what she needs to perform at her best.</p>